♪you pray for the weather

10
00:01:10,863 --> 00:01:14,200
♪but god don't answer
all your prayers

11
00:01:14,325 --> 00:01:17,536
♪your standing in the heavy rain

12
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:20,915
♪watch me change
this whole world to pain

13
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:25,586
♪逃げ場はないx3

14
00:01:25,711 --> 00:01:28,005
♪there's no way out

15
00:01:29,215 --> 00:01:32,343
♪I call the shots
straight from top down

16
00:01:32,468 --> 00:01:35,638
♪you know that I keep this block down

17
